- New auto_assign_mandatory_subjects(student) helper: adds a student's
  Mandatory/Conditional subjects from Subject Assignments without
  touching any Optional subject they already chose. Safe to re-run.
- New auto_register_students view + 'students/auto-register/' URL,
  reusing the same student_ids checkbox-selection pattern as
  Bulk Update / Delete Selected.
- New '⚡ Auto Registration' button in the Student List bulk-action bar.
---
